        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A shoot ’em up set in the world of the dark-fantasy RPG “BAROQUE”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >returns as “REVERSED”, now available on Steam.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story takes place in the Neuro Tower,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a mysterious structure overrun by countless enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must fight through them using the items you acquire along the way</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >to reach the final boss that awaits in the deepest depths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This release adds a variety of new features.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It offers plenty to enjoy for both newcomers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and those who played the original extensively.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■ Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategic Player Tuning</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Items can alter your attack power, attack pattern, and speed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Depending on the order in which you collect them and their attributes,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >you can fine-tune your setup with great precision.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple Ways to Play</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features both Standard Mode and Score Attack Mode,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >along with five difficulty levels to match your preferred play style.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■ New Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Revamped Status Display</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The status display has been completely redesigned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also switch back to the original version if you prefer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Great Heat Gallery</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A special gallery featuring wallpapers from past “Great Heat Memorial Days.”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock conditions must be met to view them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Title Wallpaper Switch Feature</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Allows you to set gallery images as the background of the title screen.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Continue Feature</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lets you restart even after a game over.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional BGM</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes several background tracks from previous BAROQUE titles,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >newly remastered for this release.</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A shoot ’em up set in the world of the dark-fantasy RPG “BAROQUE”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >returns as “REVERSED”, now available on Steam.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story takes place in the Neuro Tower,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a mysterious structure overrun by countless enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must fight through them using the items you acquire along the way</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >to reach the final boss that awaits in the deepest depths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This release adds a variety of new features.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It offers plenty to enjoy for both newcomers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and those who played the original extensively.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■ Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategic Player Tuning</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Items can alter your attack power, attack pattern, and speed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Depending on the order in which you collect them and their attributes,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >you can fine-tune your setup with great precision.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple Ways to Play</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features both Standard Mode and Score Attack Mode,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >along with five difficulty levels to match your preferred play style.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■ New Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Revamped Status Display</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The status display has been completely redesigned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also switch back to the original version if you prefer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Great Heat Gallery</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A special gallery featuring wallpapers from past “Great Heat Memorial Days.”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock conditions must be met to view them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Title Wallpaper Switch Feature</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Allows you to set gallery images as the background of the title screen.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Continue Feature</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lets you restart even after a game over.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional BGM</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes several background tracks from previous BAROQUE titles,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >newly remastered for this release.</p></li></ul>",
